     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Explaining the reason",
     "texto": [
      "To justify something you have said, as in «it's that…», use **-거든(요)** after a statement: 바빴거든요 = it's that I was busy. 피곤하거든요 = it's that I'm tired.",
      "어제 안 갔어요. 시간이 없었거든요 = I did not go yesterday, it's that I had no time."
